  <item>
    <title>EP01 《打开心智之门》：从“被看见”到“能共情”，如何拥有“向下兼容”的成熟心智？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65edb1008e6f71a5b7236c7e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65edb1008e6f71a5b7236c7e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Mar 2024 17:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;今天和大家分享的这本书叫做《打开心智之门》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作者是吴倩老师，北京师范大学心理学硕士，资深心理咨询师，著名畅销书《断舍离》的中文译者。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 心智化是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 心智化不成熟的版本：等同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> &nbsp;心智化第二个版本：缺少内外世界的桥梁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="790">13:10</a> 看似正确的规律，放在个体身上，未必正确</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> &nbsp;心智化第三个版本：拒绝思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> &nbsp;成熟的心智化版本是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> &nbsp;依恋的3种类型：安全型、回避型、矛盾型</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> 好的童年，治愈一生；不好的童年，需要用一生去治愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1892">31:32</a> 口诀1：暂停，跳出，思考对方怎么了/我怎么了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2191">36:31</a> 口诀2：别人不懂我，这才是正常的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> &nbsp;口诀3：把“肯定”换成“可能”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 什么是心理地图？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3595">59:55</a> 成年人，只筛选，不改变</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3686">1:01:26</a> 非暴力沟通4步骤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4263">1:11:03</a> &nbsp;朋友如何正确提供情绪价值？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4635">1:17:15</a> &nbsp;忠于自己，才是真正的人间清醒</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的影视剧和书籍：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>《生活大爆炸》（The Big Bang Theory）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《思考，快与慢》 丹尼尔·卡尼曼</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《非暴力沟通》 马歇尔·卢森堡</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmMoRNNV0j2veVTAr2kaipt_ewu.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrbPdie4-dY6LtIKuQVPDwnYiXo9.m4a" length="77522840" type="audio/mp4"/>
